{% doc %}
@param {object} customer - Shopify customer receiving the reminder
@param {object} contact - Company member role and preference data
@param {object} company - Client company workspace data
@param {object} assets - Open asset requests
@param {object} links - Signed links for portal actions
{% enddoc %}

{% assign locale = contact.locale | default: 'en' %}
{% assign company_name = company.name | default: customer.name | default: 'your team' %}

{% if locale == 'fr' %}
Bonjour {{ contact.name | default: customer.first_name | default: '!' | escape }},

Il reste quelques elements a confirmer pour garder le lancement {{ company_name | escape }} en mouvement.

{% for asset in assets limit: 6 %}
- {{ asset.title | escape }}: {{ asset.status | default: 'requis' | escape }}{% if asset.due %} avant {{ asset.due | escape }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

Envoyer ou commenter les assets:
{{ links.assets_url | default: links.portal_url }}

Merci,
Philippe
{% else %}
Hi {{ contact.name | default: customer.first_name | default: 'there' | escape }},

A few items still need confirmation to keep the {{ company_name | escape }} kickoff moving.

{% for asset in assets limit: 6 %}
- {{ asset.title | escape }}: {{ asset.status | default: 'needed' | escape }}{% if asset.due %} by {{ asset.due | escape }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

Upload or comment on the assets:
{{ links.assets_url | default: links.portal_url }}

Thanks,
Philippe
{% endif %}
